<view class="page reminder">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="list-row list-row-last">
      <view class="row-text">
        <text class="t-body">用餐提醒</text>
        <text class="t-caption">开着时，每打完一餐都会问要不要提醒下一餐。</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{on}}" color="#B84E0C" bindchange="onSwitch"></switch>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="notes">
    <text class="t-caption">关掉之后不再问。开关开着时，已订阅的下一餐会在窗口打开后于首页提醒一次。首页红点仍会在未打卡时提示。</text>
  </view>
</view>
